[thin] These are the preformed display wings and cosmetic bezel. The exact local inward chord is 1.2455 mm on either wing and 1.30 mm on the bezel. The wing preform supplies the display retention geometry; the cover does not contain fluid pressure or carry the countertop clamp. Physical acceptance remains limited to the identified printed articles in physical-acceptance.json.
alternatives: Thicker wings increase flexure stiffness and change the available neck/display clearance and snap fit. A thicker bezel changes the display recess and outside edge. Such changes require a separate fit review rather than a mounting-layout adjustment.
